1.0.4 2026-10-30

  - Interictal ieeg.json (sub-01 to sub-07): RecordingType discontinuous -> continuous. The EDF+D files have
    contiguous records (time-keeping of record k = k x record duration, no gap, in all 7;
    code/fix-20261030_edfd_contiguity.json). EDF files unchanged.
  - README: the published text is kept unchanged; a paragraph and the section "EDF+D flag of the interictal files"
    added.
  - No event times were changed in 1.0.4. The sub-08 ictal events file is not re-timed: it was moved unchanged out
    of the BIDS tree in 1.0.3 (below), because its 4 annotations lie after the end of the 71-s clip.

